{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测疑似网段扫描。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：Potential Network Sweep Detected。","from":"now-9m","index":["packetbeat-*","filebeat-*","logs-network_traffic.*","logs-panw.panos*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","max_signals":5,"name":"【默认】疑似网段扫描","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"781f8746-2180-4691-890c-4c96d11ca91d","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"threshold","query":"event.action:(network_flow or flow_started) and destination.port:(21 or 22 or 23 or 25 or 139 or 445 or 3389 or 5985 or 5986) and\nsource.ip:(10.0.0.0/8 or 172.16.0.0/12 or 192.168.0.0/16)\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n疑似网段扫描\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清账号、网络、主机或云资源\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threshold":{"field":["source.ip"],"value":1,"cardinality":[{"field":"destination.ip","value":100}]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1018","name":"Remote System Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1018/"},{"id":"T1046","name":"Network Service Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1046/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1595","name":"Active Scanning","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1595/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1595.001","name":"Scanning IP Blocks","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1595/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0043","name":"Reconnaissance","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0043/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"},{"package":"panw","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"version":16,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"to":"now","references":[]}
